    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dr. Montgomery's latest\u00a0patient,\u00a0Noel,\u00a0is as mysterious as\u00a0he is\u00a0prone to obfuscating.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But\u00a0there's something\u00a0odd about these sessions with him. Something left unsaid.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's almost as if... <i>they cannot\u00a0escape this room.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/a278a31ef7dc0eca97dd7e05f68990ee.avif?t=1750729975\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >|| A visual novel about\u00a0an\u00a0endless therapy session - developed, directed, produced and written by a psychologist!\u00a0||</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>50k words of content</strong>, including many optional and hidden dialogue that only the keenest of players will unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose\u00a0how to\u00a0respond to the patient's\u00a0revelations and\u00a0lies, what questions\u00a0to ask, and\u00a0<strong>when to keep quiet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/bf9fc42004826ea7fcffc981a4d1278e.poster.avif?t=1750729975\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/bf9fc42004826ea7fcffc981a4d1278e.webm?t=1750729975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/bf9fc42004826ea7fcffc981a4d1278e.mp4?t=1750729975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0<strong>Read\u00a0the doctor's\u00a0notes</strong>\u00a0to delve\u00a0into\u00a0his\u00a0line of thinking\u00a0and his\u00a0suspicions about\u00a0his\u00a0mysterious\u00a0patient</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four total endings unlocked <strong>based on <i>your </i>choices</strong>, two\u00a0being\u00a0'True\u00a0Endings' available at the very\u00a0end of the\u00a0game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Nearly 50 achievements</strong>\u00a0to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0<strong>Point-and-click mode</strong>:\u00a0Take\u00a0a breather\u00a0with Noel and\u00a0interact with the\u00a0room around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong> Affinity\u00a0System</strong>: Unlock additional\u00a0conversations and therapeutic interventions by increasing the doctor's\u00a0bond with\u00a0his patient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/151058de17f987fedea3baccad6e7987.avif?t=1750729975\" width=724 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ART\u00a0&amp; SOUND FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All original art and sound was created by Brazilian creatives. Metahorror Therapy Session is proud to showcase and celebrate Brazilian talent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Original\u00a0Soundtrack</strong> by\u00a0Guilherme Alexander</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highly expressive sprite art with\u00a0various poses\u00a0and <strong>in-engine animations </strong>by Hetsan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0<strong>3 CG illustrations </strong>by MirukiMary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Background Art</strong> by Felipe Daher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unique </strong>interactive user interface, themed after a therapist's notebook, by\u00a0Cim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0A cinematic parallax camera\u00a0that <strong>zooms in and\u00a0out, rotates, and\u00a0follows\u00a0your\u00a0mouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0Additional sounds, drones,\u00a0and effects\u00a0to further <strong>immerse you\u00a0in the\u00a0psychological metahorror</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/151058de17f987fedea3baccad6e7987.avif?t=1750729975\" width=724 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to unravel the truth behind Noel's claims?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/a106081be9efeaad171f45e3e93b8379.avif?t=1750729975\" width=271 height=366 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dr. Montgomery's latest\u00a0patient,\u00a0Noel,\u00a0is as mysterious as\u00a0he is\u00a0prone to obfuscating.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But\u00a0there's something\u00a0odd about these sessions with him. Something left unsaid.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's almost as if... <i>they cannot\u00a0escape this room.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/a278a31ef7dc0eca97dd7e05f68990ee.avif?t=1750729975\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >|| A visual novel about\u00a0an\u00a0endless therapy session - developed, directed, produced and written by a psychologist!\u00a0||</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>50k words of content</strong>, including many optional and hidden dialogue that only the keenest of players will unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose\u00a0how to\u00a0respond to the patient's\u00a0revelations and\u00a0lies, what questions\u00a0to ask, and\u00a0<strong>when to keep quiet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/bf9fc42004826ea7fcffc981a4d1278e.poster.avif?t=1750729975\" width=800 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/bf9fc42004826ea7fcffc981a4d1278e.webm?t=1750729975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/bf9fc42004826ea7fcffc981a4d1278e.mp4?t=1750729975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0<strong>Read\u00a0the doctor's\u00a0notes</strong>\u00a0to delve\u00a0into\u00a0his\u00a0line of thinking\u00a0and his\u00a0suspicions about\u00a0his\u00a0mysterious\u00a0patient</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four total endings unlocked <strong>based on <i>your </i>choices</strong>, two\u00a0being\u00a0'True\u00a0Endings' available at the very\u00a0end of the\u00a0game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Nearly 50 achievements</strong>\u00a0to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0<strong>Point-and-click mode</strong>:\u00a0Take\u00a0a breather\u00a0with Noel and\u00a0interact with the\u00a0room around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong> Affinity\u00a0System</strong>: Unlock additional\u00a0conversations and therapeutic interventions by increasing the doctor's\u00a0bond with\u00a0his patient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/151058de17f987fedea3baccad6e7987.avif?t=1750729975\" width=724 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ART\u00a0&amp; SOUND FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All original art and sound was created by Brazilian creatives. Metahorror Therapy Session is proud to showcase and celebrate Brazilian talent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Original\u00a0Soundtrack</strong> by\u00a0Guilherme Alexander</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highly expressive sprite art with\u00a0various poses\u00a0and <strong>in-engine animations </strong>by Hetsan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0<strong>3 CG illustrations </strong>by MirukiMary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Background Art</strong> by Felipe Daher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unique </strong>interactive user interface, themed after a therapist's notebook, by\u00a0Cim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0A cinematic parallax camera\u00a0that <strong>zooms in and\u00a0out, rotates, and\u00a0follows\u00a0your\u00a0mouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0Additional sounds, drones,\u00a0and effects\u00a0to further <strong>immerse you\u00a0in the\u00a0psychological metahorror</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/151058de17f987fedea3baccad6e7987.avif?t=1750729975\" width=724 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to unravel the truth behind Noel's claims?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560830/extras/a106081be9efeaad171f45e3e93b8379.avif?t=1750729975\" width=271 height=366 /></span></p>",
